{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the perimeter of the triangle shown is 21, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b838e52aeb87467a7f59c29b88e3262362994c69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"369\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perimeter\" title=\"Perimeter\">perimeter</a> of a shape is the sum of its side lengths. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/6/366b83e0ff647b4287a8485dd3c68c71bf5d596e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 1 + x + x + 1 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/d/c4d1909e54a517fbc38d3a8a72bc9561787e616e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/4/894adde960b1f4153ae855a17001e82ac1757308.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{21}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/inde